# Slice 283 probe: a callable place given a value read through a free holder's path, then called.  Entry 7.
Other:
    int: q 3
end: Other
Holds:
    @: p Other Other
end: Holds
Places:
    fn: f () int
        return: 1
    end: f
end: Places
int: Hw 0
fn: write_free () int
    @: Places\f Hw\p
    ---
        int: r Places\f()
        return: 11
        catch: call ()
            return: 1
    ---
end: write_free
fn: run () int
    @: Hw Holds Holds
    return: write_free()
end: run
int: code 7
if: run() != 1
    code: 12
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
